  {"what": "a case whose service did not parse out of its directory name", "ours": "counts as a miss, because the scorer requires a non-empty component", "upstream": "compares Node('', 'unknown') like any other node, so it can be a hit", "why": "Reachable only through an export whose case directory violates the layout parseRcaEvalPath/parseRcaEvalDirectory accept, which the structural gate rejects before scoring. Recorded so the guard is a decision rather than an accident."}
 ],
